30,"enabled_background":false,"collection_card_color_scheme_light":"","collection_card_color_scheme_dark":"","show_item_count":false,"enable_desktop_slider":true,"swiper_on_mobile":true,"desktop_content_position":"center","columns_desktop":8,"spacing":12,"columns_mobile":2,"spacing_mobile":8,"section_width":"full-width","padding_top":48,"padding_bottom":0,"show_section_divider":false,"color_scheme_light":"scheme-1","color_scheme_dark":""}},"promotional_collections_fi9NTB":{"type":"promotional-collections","blocks":{"collection_gyMPU9":{"type":"collection","settings":{"collection":"","show_vendor":true,"show_product_rating":true,"show_quickview":true,"show_label_badges":true,"enable_card":false,"card_position":"left","enable_sticky":false,"product":"","card_link":"","open_card_link_new_window":false,"video_url":"","video_alt_text":"","show_sound_control":false,"enable_video_autoplay":false,"overlay_opacity":10,"content_alignment":"center","content_position":"center","image_ratio":"responsive","desktop_width":200,"mobile_height":200,"heading":"Promotional collection","heading_size":"medium","text":"<p>10% OFF<\/p>","text_size":"medium","highlight_effect":"underline","text_transform":"none","button_label":"","button_link":"","open_new_window_button":false,"show_button_style":"primary","enable_countdown":true,"countdown_text":"Hurry up! Get the best deal at best price.","countdown_text_size":"medium","timezone":"-4","end_year":2025,"end_month":"1","end_day":"1","end_hour":"0","end_minute":"0","show_border_around_timer":true,"color_scheme_light":"","color_scheme_dark":""}}},"block_order":["collection_gyMPU9"],"name":"t:promotional_collections.name","settings":{"subheading":"","heading":"Room - Best Sellers","heading_size":"medium","heading_tag":"h2","highlight_effect":"underline","text_transform":"none","heading_alignment":"left","mobile_heading_alignment":"center","view_all_button_label":"See All","view_all_button_position":"above","view_all_button_style":"text-link","title_size":"medium","title_style":"normal-case","show_collection_image":false,"enable_desktop_slider":true,"swiper_on_mobile":true,"change_slides_speed":0,"show_navigation_arrows":true,"show_background_product":false,"desktop_side_padding":18,"mobile_side_padding":12,"background_color_product_light":"#ffffff","background_color_product_dark":"#171a22","desktop_products_per_row":6,"desktop_number_of_rows":3,"spacing":8,"mobile_products_per_row":"2","spacing_mobile":8,"section_width":"full-width","padding_top":48,"padding_bottom":0,"show_section_divider":false,"color_scheme_light":"","color_scheme_dark":""}},"faq_Fkji9N":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"frequently_asked_question_fXdfHe":{"type":"frequently_asked_question","settings":{"icon":"none","another_icon":"","heading":"Q: What Are The Different Types Of Sofa?","row_content":"<p>There are varioustypes of sofasbased on their seating capacity and sizes. You can choose to buy 3 seater sofa, 2 seater sofa, 1 seater sofa, sectional sofas, L shaped sofas, reclining sofas, or sofa cum beds. Some premium sofas are practically designed to enhance everyday comfort with its smart features. These sofas contain adjustable headrest and backrests, which lets you personalize your comfort as well as transform a sofa into a day bed. A built-in USB port lets you stay connected while you lounge. High end 3 seater reclining sofa comes with glider, rocker or electric massager for a sublime comfort. Reading light, wireless charger, storage console with cup holder adds to your comfort while you unwind.<\/p>","highlight_effect":"underline","text_transform":"none"}},"frequently_asked_question_mRdwhc":{"type":"frequently_asked_question","settings":{"icon":"none","another_icon":"","heading":"Q: How To Take Care And Maintain Sofa?","row_content":"<p>Here are some tips about how to take care of your sofa.<\/p><ul><li>Fluff cushions regularly to help them keep their shape.<\/li><li>Check to ensure the legs are fitted tightly to the sofa on a regular basis.<\/li><li>Avoid direct sunlight as it will affect your furniture.<\/li><li>It can cause your furniture to lose its shine and luster and begin to fade.<\/li><li>Vacuum your furniture regularly with a soft brush nozzle. Do not jump or sit on the handles.<\/li><li>Cover your sofa when it's not in use. This will protect it from sunlight, dirt, and debris.<\/li><li>In case of spill or stain, clean immediately.<\/li><\/ul><p>For material care tips, click to know more about leather care instructions, leatherette care instructions, and fabric care instructions.<\/p>","highlight_effect":"underline","text_transform":"none"}},"frequently_asked_question_N6DegM":{"type":"frequently_asked_question","settings":{"icon":"none","another_icon":"","heading":"Q: What Type Of Sofa Is Ideal For Elderly People?","row_content":"<p>Vast sofas are designed for all generations. However, some premium sofas are designed keeping in mind the comfort of elderly people, pregnant women, or those with muscle problems. The sofas with the firm or semi-soft cushioning offer the right amount of support and help a person to easily get up without putting extra pressure on their back or knee muscles. Manual and power reclining sofas are another great option for comfortable seating. Some premium reclining sofas house a power lift-up mechanism, which completely lifts the chair up, helping a person to sleep and easily stand up on their own. Explore our premium sofas  which make a great choice for your elderly loved ones.<br\/><br\/><\/p>","highlight_effect":"underline","text_transform":"none"}},"frequently_asked_question_mpkE4X":{"type":"frequently_asked_question","settings":{"icon":"none","another_icon":"","heading":"Q: How Can I Make Sure That The Sofa Will Fit My Living Room?","row_content":"<p>Check the dimensions of your chosen piece - To ensure your chosen seating is going to work with your space, you will require the dimensions. Make sure you note down all of the essential measurements of the products: the width (W), the height (H), and the depth (D).<\/p><p>Measure Your sofa - As well as working out the dimensions of your sofa, you'll have to measure where you're going to put it in order to ensure it's going to fit the way you want it to.<\/p><p>Regular Sofa Set - Depending on the type of sofa you're looking to buy, there are a few things you'll need to consider, and we're going to take you through those here.<\/p><p>Corner and L shape sofa - For corner and l- shaped sofas have two lengths on either side, that you'll need to measure, and the depth of each section.<\/p><p>Sofa bed - Sofa beds also come with their own set of challenges when it comes to measuring them. This is because, not only do you have to work out the dimensions of the sofa component, but you'll need to account for the depth once the bed section has been extended, as you'll want to ensure there's enough space in front of your sofa once it's positioned how you want it.<\/p><p>Measure your space post selection to ensure the sofa you have chosen works well.<\/p>","highlight_effect":"underline","text_transform":"none"}},"frequently_asked_question_b8MnME":{"type":"frequently_asked_question","settings":{"icon":"none","another_icon":"","heading":"Q: What Is The Best Upholstery For A Sofa?","row_content":"<p>Sofas are available in various materials like Leather sofas, leatherette sofas, fabric sofas, and velvet sofas. One should consider the users while selecting the sofa upholstery. For those looking for premium sofas can go for genuine leather. Leatherette sofas are anti-peel and are best for active families with kids and pets. The traditional fabric sofas and velvet sofas make your living room cozy and welcoming.<\/p>","highlight_effect":"underline","text_transform":"none"}}},"block_order":["frequently_asked_question_fXdfHe","frequently_asked_question_mRdwhc","frequently_asked_question_N6DegM","frequently_asked_question_mpkE4X","frequently_asked_question_b8MnME"],"name":"t:faq.name","settings":{"